/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 48 0 R
/T (Automation is a central feature of low-code platforms. Rules, triggers and scheduled actions can perform repetitive tasks without manual effort. Because much of the routine programming is handled by the platform, development effort is reduced and applications can be delivered faster. Low-code platforms are also accessible to a wider group of people: professional developers use them to speed up their work, and)
/E (Automation is a central feature of low-code platforms. Rules, triggers and scheduled actions can perform repetitive tasks without manual effort. Because much of the routine programming is handled by the platform, development effort is reduced and applications can be delivered faster. Low-code platforms are also accessible to a wider group of people: professional developers use them to speed up their work, and)
