/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 55 0 R
/T (Low-code development provides an accessible and efficient approach to application development, and it is creating a growing range of career opportunities. Visual tools, reusable components and automation allow applications to be delivered faster and allow both professional developers and business users to contribute. Career progression can begin with low-code application development and advance towards automation, integration, consulting, solution development and architecture. At each stage, technical depth and responsibility increase, and skills in databases, APIs, programming, automation and business understanding become more important.)
/E (Low-code development provides an accessible and efficient approach to application development, and it is creating a growing range of career opportunities. Visual tools, reusable components and automation allow applications to be delivered faster and allow both professional developers and business users to contribute. Career progression can begin with low-code application development and advance towards automation, integration, consulting, solution development and architecture. At each stage, technical depth and responsibility increase, and skills in databases, APIs, programming, automation and business understanding become more important.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [20]
>>
endobj
366 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 55 0 R
/T (The future of low-code development will be strongly influenced by AI, automation, APIs, cloud technologies and collaboration between low-code and pro-code approaches. Developer roles are expected to evolve rather than disappear. A strong future-ready developer should therefore combine low-code platform knowledge with programming fundamentals, databases, APIs, AI tools and business understanding.)
/E (The future of low-code development will be strongly influenced by AI, automation, APIs, cloud technologies and collaboration between low-code and pro-code approaches. Developer roles are expected to evolve rather than disappear. A strong future-ready developer should therefore combine low-code platform knowledge with programming fundamentals, databases, APIs, AI tools and business understanding.)
/Pg 17 0 R
